{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "La Residencia del Doctor Gallagher",
    "steam_appid": 3534760,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534760/extras/88a76f842679898a36254bfde9e24043.webp?t=1753741278\" width=793 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WELCOME!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To nostalgic lovers of graphic adventures, as well as to unwanted snoopers, welcome to Doctor Gallagher's residence!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the peculiar mansion to uncover the darkest secrets, wrapped in stories of love, forgetfulness, and greed. Each room, each character has its own story. And each story intersects in the thin line of our host's madness, Dr. Gallagher. A night turned upside down, with the breeze of classic adventures of yesteryear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of all the places it could have hidden, your cat definitely chose the worst.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a 2D adventure inspired by the classic point-and-click style of the early '90s, with a six-verb interface to interact with the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the pretext of finding your cat, the game will allow you to take on the role of Arnoldo and his three friends as they venture into the eccentric Dr. Gallagher's Residence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a map that will progressively expand as you advance through the story, revealing countless passageways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun interacting with the eccentric characters that inhabit the residence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Thinking</i></strong> is the only mechanic. Use your ingenuity to solve the puzzles that will appear in your path to progress through the delirious story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534760/extras/9d2f0961c4f39f965ae6d6d17157cee8.poster.avif?t=1753741278\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534760/extras/9d2f0961c4f39f965ae6d6d17157cee8.webm?t=1753741278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534760/extras/9d2f0961c4f39f965ae6d6d17157cee8.mp4?t=1753741278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534760/extras/88a76f842679898a36254bfde9e24043.webp?t=1753741278\" width=793 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WELCOME!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To nostalgic lovers of graphic adventures, as well as to unwanted snoopers, welcome to Doctor Gallagher's residence!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the peculiar mansion to uncover the darkest secrets, wrapped in stories of love, forgetfulness, and greed. Each room, each character has its own story. And each story intersects in the thin line of our host's madness, Dr. Gallagher. A night turned upside down, with the breeze of classic adventures of yesteryear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of all the places it could have hidden, your cat definitely chose the worst.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a 2D adventure inspired by the classic point-and-click style of the early '90s, with a six-verb interface to interact with the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the pretext of finding your cat, the game will allow you to take on the role of Arnoldo and his three friends as they venture into the eccentric Dr. Gallagher's Residence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a map that will progressively expand as you advance through the story, revealing countless passageways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun interacting with the eccentric characters that inhabit the residence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Thinking</i></strong> is the only mechanic. Use your ingenuity to solve the puzzles that will appear in your path to progress through the delirious story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534760/extras/9d2f0961c4f39f965ae6d6d17157cee8.poster.avif?t=1753741278\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534760/extras/9d2f0961c4f39f965ae6d6d17157cee8.webm?t=1753741278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534760/extras/9d2f0961c4f39f965ae6d6d17157cee8.mp4?t=1753741278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
